1.19, 136.96, 1221.1100000000001]}, {"polygon": [[172.8, 1191.19], [293.12, 1191.19], [293.12, 1221.1100000000001], [172.8, 1221.1100000000001]], "confidence": 0.9698005746537556, "label": "Text", "raw_label": "Text", "reading_order": 25, "html": "<p>mwafu (1)</p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [172.8, 1191.19, 293.12, 1221.1100000000001]}, {"polygon": [[403.2, 1191.19], [495.36, 1191.19], [495.36, 1221.1100000000001], [403.2, 1221.1100000000001]], "confidence": 0.9698005746537556, "label": "Text", "raw_label": "Text", "reading_order": 26, "html": "<p>bafu (2)</p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [403.2, 1191.19, 495.36, 1221.1100000000001]}, {"polygon": [[627.2, 1191.19], [1012.48, 1191.19], [1012.48, 1277.21], [627.2, 1277.21]], "confidence": 0.9698005746537556, "label": "Text", "raw_label": "Text", "reading_order": 27, "html": "<p>: mwenyi buchafu kila siku.<br/>いつも汚れた身なりをしている人、<br/>personne toujours habillée sale.</p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [627.2, 1191.19, 1012.48, 1277.21]}, {"polygon": [[176.64000000000001, 1303.3899999999999], [296.96000000000004, 1303.3899999999999], [296.96000000000004, 1333.31], [176.64000000000001, 1333.31]], "confidence": 0.9698005746537556, "label": "Text", "raw_label": "Text", "reading_order": 28, "html": "<p>bwafu (14)</p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [176.64000000000001, 1303.3899999999999, 296.96000000000004, 1333.31]}, {"polygon": [[627.2, 1303.3899999999999], [1006.08, 1303.3899999999999], [1006.08, 1391.28], [627.2, 1391.28]], "confidence": 0.9698005746537556, "label": "Text", "raw_label": "Text", "reading_order": 29, "html": "<p>: hali ya kuwa buchafu kila siku.<br/>いつも不潔にしていること、<br/>malpropreté habituelle.</p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [627.2, 1303.3899999999999, 1006.08, 1391.28]}, {"polygon": [[74.24000000000001, 1417.46], [136.96, 1417.46], [136.96, 1445.51], [74.24000000000001, 1445.51]], "confidence": 0.9698005746537556, "label": "Text", "raw_label": "Text", "reading_order": 30, "html": "<p>-àh<sup>-1</sup></p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [74.24000000000001, 1417.46, 136.96, 1445.51]}, {"polygon": [[172.8, 1417.46], [256.0, 1417.46], [256.0, 1445.51], [172.8, 1445.51]], "confidence": 0.9698005746537556, "label": "Text", "raw_label": "Text", "reading_order": 31, "html": "<p>kwáhá</p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [172.8, 1417.46, 256.0, 1445.51]}, {"polygon": [[627.2, 1417.46], [971.52, 1417.46], [971.52, 1503.48], [627.2, 1503.48]], "confidence": 0.9698005746537556, "label": "Text", "raw_label": "Text", "reading_order": 32, "html": "<p>: kukutana.<br/>(川が)合流する、<br/>confluer, se réunir (revières).</p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [627.2, 1417.46, 971.52, 1503.48]}, {"polygon": [[176.64000000000001, 1527.79], [352.0, 1527.79], [352.0, 1559.58], [176.64000000000001, 1559.58]], "confidence": 0.9698005746537556, "label": "Text", "raw_label": "Text", "reading_order": 33, "html": "<p>kwáháná (ass?)</p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [176.64000000000001, 1527.79, 352.0, 1559.58]}, {"polygon": [[627.2, 1527.79], [1064.96, 1527.79], [1064.96, 1617.55], [627.2, 1617.55]], "confidence": 0.9698005746537556, "label": "Text", "raw_label": "Text", "reading_order": 34, "html": "<p>: kuachana ao kujigabula kwa mutoni.<br/>(川が)分岐する、<br/>bifurquer, se séparer (rivière).</p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [627.2, 1527.79, 1064.96, 1617.55]}, {"polygon": [[570.88, 1737.23], [669.44, 1737.23], [669.44, 1767.1499999999999], [570.88, 1767.1499999999999]], "confidence": 0.9698005746537556, "label": "PageFooter", "raw_label": "Page-Footer", "reading_order": 35, "html": "<p>- 5 -</p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [570.88, 1737.23, 669.44, 1767.1499999999999]}], "image_bbox": [0.0, 0.0, 1280.0, 1870.0], "page": 4}, {"blocks": [{"polygon": [[204.8, 149.6], [1109.76, 149.6], [1109.76, 237.49], [204.8, 237.49]], "confidence": 0.9661970892023998, "label": "Text", "raw_label": "Text", "reading_order": 0, "html": "<p>mwahana (3) myahana (4) : mutoni yenyi kujigabula sehemu mbili.<br/>川の支流、<br/>affluent.</p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [204.8, 149.6, 1109.76, 237.49]}, {"polygon": [[204.8, 261.8], [1091.84, 261.8], [1091.84, 349.69], [204.8, 349.69]], "confidence": 0.9661970892023998, "label": "Text", "raw_label": "Text", "reading_order": 1, "html": "<p>cahanu (7) byahanu (8) : fasi katikati ya vitu ao batu mbili.<br/>二点間の距離あるいはその空間、間隔、<br/>espace entre deux points, intervalle.</p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [204.8, 261.8, 1091.84, 349.69]}, {"polygon": [[104.96000000000001, 374.0], [1113.6, 374.0], [1113.6, 463.76], [104.96000000000001, 463.76]], "confidence": 0.9661970892023998, "label": "Text", "raw_label": "Text", "reading_order": 2, "html": "<p>-āh-<sup>2</sup> kwāhā : kufunguka, kupasuka.<br/>ドアの開いている, (服が)破れている、<br/>être ouvert (porte), être déchiré (habit).</p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [104.96000000000001, 374.0, 1113.6, 463.76]}, {"polygon": [[204.8, 488.07], [1091.84, 488.07], [1091.84, 574.09], [204.8, 574.09]], "confidence": 0.9661970892023998, "label": "Text", "raw_label": "Text", "reading_order": 3, "html": "<p>kwāhūlā (tr.) : kufungula, kupasula.<br/>(ドアを)開く, (服を)破る、<br/>ouvrir, déchirer.</p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [204.8, 488.07, 1091.84, 574.09]}, {"polygon": [[204.8, 598.4], [1199.3600000000001, 598.4], [1199.3600000000001, 686.29], [204.8, 686.29]], "confidence": 0.9661970892023998, "label": "Text", "raw_label": "Text", "reading_order": 4, "html": "<p>mwahurē (adj. inv. 18?) : wazi.<br/>空(から)の、<br/>vide.</p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [204.8, 598.4, 1199.3600000000001, 686.29]}, {"polygon": [[204.8, 714.34], [1199.3600000000001, 714.34], [1199.3600000000001, 800.36], [204.8, 800.36]], "confidence": 0.9661970892023998, "label": "Text", "raw_label": "Text", "reading_order": 5, "html": "<p>nyūmbā mwahurē : nyumba wazi.<br/>空(から)の家、戸の開け放たれている家、<br/>maison vide, dont la porte est laissée ouverte.</p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [204.8, 714.34, 1199.3600000000001, 800.36]}, {"polygon": [[104.96000000000001, 822.8], [1199.3600000000001, 822.8], [1199.3600000000001, 910.6899999999999], [104.96000000000001, 910.6899999999999]], "confidence": 0.9661970892023998, "label": "Text", "raw_label": "Text", "reading_order": 6, "html": "<p>-(?)āh- kwāhā ~kūhāā : kukuwa baridi.<br/>冷たい、<br/>être ou devenir froid, frais.</p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [104.96000000000001, 822.8, 1199.3600000000001, 910.6899999999999]}, {"polygon": [[204.8, 935.0], [1091.84, 935.0], [1091.84, 1024.76], [204.8, 1024.76]], "confidence": 0.9661970892023998, "label": "Text", "raw_label": "Text", "reading_order": 7, "html": "<p>mwaha (myaha<br/>~muaha (3) ~miaha (4)) : baridi.<br/>物の冷たさ、体の冷え、<br/>froid, fraicheur.</p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [204.8, 935.0, 1091.84, 1024.76]}, {"polygon": [[104.96000000000001, 1047.2], [1091.84, 1047.2], [1091.84, 1135.09], [104.96000000000001, 1135.09]], "confidence": 0.9661970892023998, "label": "Text", "raw_label": "Text", "reading_order": 8, "html": "<p>-ʔāh-<sup>1</sup> kūhāhā : kulapisha.<br/>誓わせる、<br/>faire jurer.</p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [104.96000000000001, 1047.2, 1091.84, 1135.09]}, {"polygon": [[204.8, 1159.4], [1199.3600000000001, 1159.4], [1199.3600000000001, 1249.16], [204.8, 1249.16]], "confidence": 0.9661970892023998, "label": "Text", "raw_label": "Text", "reading_order": 9, "html": "<p>kūciāhā (réfl.) : kulapa.<br/>誓う、<br/>jurer, faire serment.</p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [204.8, 1159.4, 1199.3600000000001, 1249.16]}, {"polygon": [[104.96000000000001, 1271.6000000000001], [1091.84, 1271.6000000000001], [1091.84, 1361.36], [104.96000000000001, 1361.36]], "confidence": 0.9661970892023998, "label": "Text", "raw_label": "Text", "reading_order": 10, "html": "<p>-ʔāh-<sup>2</sup> kūhāhānā : kutulia kwa bazimu.<br/>先祖の霊が鎮まる、<br/>s'apaiser (esprits des ancêtres).</p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [104.96000000000001, 1271.6000000000001, 1091.84, 1361.36]}, {"polygon": [[204.8, 1383.8], [1199.3600000000001, 1383.8], [1199.3600000000001, 1473.5600000000002], [204.8, 1473.5600000000002]], "confidence": 0.9661970892023998, "label": "Text", "raw_label": "Text", "reading_order": 11, "html": "<p>būhāhānyī (14) : utulivu ya bazimu.<br/>先祖の霊が鎮まること、<br/>apaisement des esprits.</p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [204.8, 1383.8, 1199.3600000000001, 1473.5600000000002]}, {"polygon": [[204.8, 1496.0], [1199.3600000000001, 1496.0], [1199.3600000000001, 1589.5], [204.8, 1589.5]], "confidence": 0.9661970892023998, "label": "Text", "raw_label": "Text", "reading_order": 12, "html": "<p>kūhāhānyā (caus.) : kutuliza bazimu.<br/>先祖の霊を鎮める、<br/>apaiser les esprits.</p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [204.8, 1496.0, 1199.3600000000001, 1589.5]}, {"polygon": [[601.5999999999999, 1739.1000000000001], [691.2, 1739.1000000000001], [691.2, 1767.1499999999999], [601.5999999999999, 1767.1499999999999]], "confidence": 0.9661970892023998, "label": "PageFooter", "raw_label": "Page-Footer", "reading_order": 13, "html": "<p>— 6 —</p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [601.5999999999999, 1739.1000000000001, 691.2, 1767.1499999999999]}], "image_bbox": [0.0, 0.0, 1280.0, 1870.0], "page": 5}, {"blocks": [{"polygon": [[49.92, 140.25], [1144.32, 140.25], [1144.32, 1696.0900000000001], [49.92, 1696.0900000000001]], "confidence": 0.9823343087615883, "label": "Table", "raw_label": "Table", "reading_order": 0, "html": "<table border=\"0\">\n<tr>\n<td>-ʔáh-<sup>3</sup></td>\n<td>kúáhírá</td>\n<td>: kukatulula.<br/>(焼き畑のため)切り倒した, あるいは風などで倒れた木の枝を払う.<br/>couper les branches des arbres abattus dans un champ (<i>ńbake</i>) ou renversés sur la route.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-áhá</td>\n<td>cáhá (7)</td>\n<td>: kipande ya muti ao ya kioo.<br/>木の切りくず, ガラスの破片.<br/>fragment, débris, éclat (de bois, verre, etc.).</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-káhá</td>\n<td>káhá (12)</td>\n<td>: kipande kidogo ya muti ao ya kioo; nyumba ya kobe.<br/>木の切りかす, ガラスのかけら; 亀の甲.<br/>petit fragment (de bois, verre, etc.); carapace de tortue.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-ʔáhá</td>\n<td>múáhá (3)</td>\n<td>: aina ya ndege.<br/>[鳥]エポシドリの一種(Hartlaub's touraco?),<br/>esp. de touraco.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-ʔàhá</td>\n<td>máahá (6)</td>\n<td>: mapas(h)a.<br/>双生児,<br/>jumeaux, jumelles.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>nábáahá (1a)</td>\n<td>bánábáahá (2a)</td>\n<td>: mama ya mapas(h)a.<br/>双生児の母親,<br/>mère de jumeaux ou de jumelles.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>habáahá (1a)</td>\n<td>báhabáhá (2a)</td>\n<td>: baba ya mapas(h)a.<br/>双生児の父親,<br/>père de jumeaux ou de jumelles.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ciáha (7)</td>\n<td>biáha (8)</td>\n<td>: kutu yenyi kukamatama.<br/>二つひっついた物,<br/>objets jumeaux.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-ʔàhà</td>\n<td>cíaha (7)</td>\n<td>: mukono, mi-<br/>手,<br/>main.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>kúhutá écíaha</td>\n<td></td>\n<td>: kupiga kofi.<br/>平手で殴る,<br/>donner une gifle à qn.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ndándá y'écíaha</td>\n<td></td>\n<td>: ndani ya mukono.<br/>掌, 手のひら,<br/>paume de la main.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ńgaha (9, 10)</td>\n<td></td>\n<td>: -kofi, ma-.<br/>拍手,<br/>battement de mains, applaudissement.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>kúhutá éngaha</td>\n<td></td>\n<td>: kupiga mikono, kushangilia.<br/>拍手する,<br/>battre des mains, applaudire.</td>\n</tr>\n</table>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [49.92, 140.25, 1144.32, 1696.0900000000001]}, {"polygon": [[544.0, 1729.75], [646.4, 1729.75], [646.4, 1767.1499999999999], [544.0, 1767.1499999999999]], "confidence": 0.9823343087615883, "label": "PageFooter", "raw_label": "Page-Footer", "reading_order": 1, "html": "<p>- 7 -</p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [544.0, 1729.75, 646.4, 1767.1499999999999]}], "image_bbox": [0.0, 0.0, 1280.0, 1870.0], "page": 6}, {"blocks": [{"polygon": [[112.63999999999999, 142.12], [1207.04, 142.12], [1207.04, 1669.91], [112.63999999999999, 1669.91]], "confidence": 0.9862337542435304, "label": "Table", "raw_label": "Table", "reading_order": 0, "html": "<table border=\"0\">\n<tr>\n<td>-âî</td>\n<td>câî (7)</td>\n<td>(byâî (8))</td>\n<td>: fasi ya kuchezea.<br/>踊りの輪の中、<br/>intérieur de rond de danse.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-<sup>2</sup>âî</td>\n<td>ciaî (7)</td>\n<td>biaî (8)</td>\n<td>: aina ya samaki.<br/>魚の一種、<br/>esp. de poisson.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-<sup>2</sup>âî</td>\n<td>mûâîâî (3)</td>\n<td>mîâîâî (4)</td>\n<td>: onjo yenyi buchungu kidogo.<br/>酸っぱさ、<br/>aigreur, acidité, goût sur.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-âîrâ</td>\n<td>câîrâ (7)</td>\n<td>byâîrâ (8)</td>\n<td>: ugonjwa ya kuambukia yenyi kuua batu mingi.<br/>伝染病(コレラ, 赤痢など)、<br/>maladie contagieuse très dangereuse (choléra,<br/>dysenterie, etc.).</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-âk-</td>\n<td>kwâkûsâ (+caus.)</td>\n<td></td>\n<td>: kuita kwa mbali, kupana alama ya<br/>kukumbusha.<br/>遠くから呼ぶ, 少し離れたところから合図をする、<br/>appeler de loin, faire un signal à qn.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td>kwâkûsânâ (+caus. + récipr.)</td>\n<td></td>\n<td>: kuitana kwa mbali, kupanana alama ya<br/>kukumbusha.<br/>遠くから呼びあう, 少し離れたところから合図を<br/>出しあう、<br/>s'appeler l'un l'autre de loin, se faire un signal l'<br/>un à l'autre.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-âk<sup>-1</sup></td>\n<td>kwâkâ</td>\n<td></td>\n<td>: kupakula.<br/>鍋を火からおろす, 食べ物を皿によそう、<br/>retirer la marmite du feu, remplir une assiette<br/>de nourriture.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td>kwâkîrâ (appl.)</td>\n<td></td>\n<td>: kupakulia.<br/>(人に)食べ物をよそう, 給仕する、<br/>servir à manger à qn.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-âk<sup>-2</sup></td>\n<td>kwâkâ</td>\n<td></td>\n<td>: kutia kuni yulu ya kahala.<br/>薪を台所のかまどの上の棚に積んでおく、<br/>mettre du bois de chauffage au grenier (pour<br/>sécher).</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-âk<sup>-3</sup></td>\n<td>kwâkâ</td>\n<td></td>\n<td>: kupakala.<br/>(ペンキ, 油などを)塗る、<br/>peindre qc à la peinture, enduire qc d'huile.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td>kwâkîrâ (appl.)</td>\n<td></td>\n<td>: kupakalia.<br/>(人)のために塗る、<br/>peindre, enduire pour qn.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td>kwâkyâ (caus.)</td>\n<td></td>\n<td>: kupakalisha.<br/>塗らせる、<br/>faire peindre, enduire.</td>\n</tr>\n</table>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [112.63999999999999, 142.12, 1207.04, 1669.91]}, {"polygon": [[599.0400000000001, 1731.6200000000001], [706.5600000000001, 1731.6200000000001], [706.5600000000001, 1761.54], [599.0400000000001, 1761.54]], "confidence": 0.9862337542435304, "label": "PageFooter", "raw_label": "Page-Footer", "reading_order": 1, "html": "<p>- 8 -</p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [599.0400000000001, 1731.6200000000001, 706.5600000000001, 1761.54]}], "image_bbox": [0.0, 0.0, 1280.0, 1870.0], "page": 7}, {"blocks": [{"polygon": [[151.04, 140.25], [1143.04, 140.25], [1143.04, 1666.17], [151.04, 1666.17]], "confidence": 0.9850595844456397, "label": "Table", "raw_label": "Table", "reading_order": 0, "html": "<table border=\"0\">\n<tr>\n<td>kwākisā (caus.)</td>\n<td>:</td>\n<td>syn. du précédent.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>kūcakā (réfl.)</td>\n<td>:</td>\n<td>kujipakala.<br/>体に塗る。<br/>se peindre, s'enduire.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>kwākābā</td>\n<td>:</td>\n<td>kupakala.<br/>(せっけん, 石灰などを)顔・体に塗る。<br/>se peindre le corps.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>kwākābā éngakā</td>\n<td>:</td>\n<td>kupakala chokaa.<br/>(儀礼のとき)体全体に石灰を塗る。<br/>s'enduire le corps de chaux (à l'occasion de rites).</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-āk<sup>-4</sup></td>\n<td>kwākā</td>\n<td>:</td>\n<td>kufanya ufumu.<br/>裁判儀礼<i>cinyama</i>を行う。<br/>pratiquer le rite judiciaire de <i>cinyama</i>.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>kwākirā (appl.)</td>\n<td>:</td>\n<td>kufanyizia mutu ufumu.<br/>(人)のために裁判儀礼をする。<br/>pratiquer le <i>cinyoma</i> pour qn.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-āk<sup>-5</sup></td>\n<td>kwākā</td>\n<td>:</td>\n<td>kukimbia.<br/>逃避する。<br/>fuir, éviter le danger, se sauver.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>mwākō (3)</td>\n<td>myākō (4)</td>\n<td>:</td>\n<td>kimbio, ukimbizi.<br/>逃避, 避難。<br/>fuite.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>kwākirā (appl.)</td>\n<td>:</td>\n<td>kukimbilia.<br/>(場所)へ避難する。<br/>fuir à, se réfugier dans.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>lwākirō<br/>~lwakirō (11)</td>\n<td>mākirō<br/>~makirō (6)</td>\n<td>:</td>\n<td>kimbilio, ma-.<br/>避難場所。<br/>lieu de refuge, abri.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>kwākyā (caus.)</td>\n<td>:</td>\n<td>kukimbiza, kufukuza.<br/>避難させる；追い返す, 追い出す。<br/>faire fuir; repousser, mettre qn à la porte.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-(?)āk<sup>-1</sup></td>\n<td>kwākānā~kūākānā</td>\n<td>:</td>\n<td>kukatala, ku(a)kana.<br/>否定(否認)する, 断わる, 拒絶する。<br/>nier, refuser, rejeter.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>mwākānō<br/>~mūākānō (3)</td>\n<td>(myākānō<br/>~mīākānō (4))</td>\n<td>:</td>\n<td>ukatalo,-.<br/>否定, 否認, 断わり, 拒絶。<br/>négation, refus, rejet.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>kwākānyā~kūākānyā (caus.)</td>\n<td>:</td>\n<td>kukataza.<br/>禁止する。<br/>interdire.</td>\n</tr>\n</table>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [151.04, 140.25, 1143.04, 1666.17]}, {"polygon": [[540.16, 1729.75], [640.0, 1729.75], [640.0, 1759.6699999999998], [540.16, 1759.6699999999998]], "confidence": 0.9850595844456397, "label": "PageFooter", "raw_label": "Page-Footer", "reading_order": 1, "html": "<p>- 9 -</p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [540.16, 1729.75, 640.0, 1759.6699999999998]}], "image_bbox": [0.0, 0.0, 1280.0, 1870.0], "page": 8}, {"blocks": [{"polygon": [[221.44, 147.73], [396.8, 147.73], [396.8, 207.57], [221.44, 207.57]], "confidence": 0.9675410220516297, "label": "Text", "raw_label": "Text", "reading_order": 0, "html": "<p>mwákányī<br/>~múákányī (1)</p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [221.44, 147.73, 396.8, 207.57]}, {"polygon": [[450.55999999999995, 147.73], [615.68, 147.73], [615.68, 207.57], [450.55999999999995, 207.57]], "confidence": 0.9675410220516297, "label": "Text", "raw_label": "Text", "reading_order": 1, "html": "<p>bákányī<br/>~bákányī (2)</p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [450.55999999999995, 147.73, 615.68, 207.57]}, {"polygon": [[669.44, 147.73], [1109.76, 147.73], [1109.76, 235.62], [669.44, 235.62]], "confidence": 0.9675410220516297, "label": "Text", "raw_label": "Text", "reading_order": 2, "html": "<p>: mwenyi kukataza; muachanishi, ba-.<br/>禁止する人.<br/>celui qui interdit.</p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [669.44, 147.73, 1109.76, 235.62]}, {"polygon": [[221.44, 261.8], [504.32000000000005, 261.8], [504.32000000000005, 291.72], [221.44, 291.72]], "confidence": 0.9675410220516297, "label": "Text", "raw_label": "Text", "reading_order": 3, "html": "<p>bwákányī~búákányī (14)</p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [221.44, 261.8, 504.32000000000005, 291.72]}, {"polygon": [[669.44, 259.93], [983.04, 259.93], [983.04, 344.08], [669.44, 344.08]], "confidence": 0.9675410220516297, "label": "Text", "raw_label": "Text", "reading_order": 4, "html": "<p>: ukatazo, -; uachanisho, -.<br/>禁止.<br/>interdiction.</p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [669.44, 259.93, 983.04, 344.08]}, {"polygon": [[221.44, 372.13], [579.84, 372.13], [579.84, 403.92], [221.44, 403.92]], "confidence": 0.9675410220516297, "label": "Text", "raw_label": "Text", "reading_order": 5, "html": "<p>kwákányīrá~kúákányīrá (appl.)</p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [221.44, 372.13, 579.84, 403.92]}, {"polygon": [[669.44, 372.13], [1210.8799999999999, 372.13], [1210.8799999999999, 488.07], [669.44, 488.07]], "confidence": 0.9675410220516297, "label": "Text", "raw_label": "Text", "reading_order": 6, "html": "<p>: kukatalia, kuakania.<br/>(人)のために否定する, あの人がそんなことをするはずがないと言う.<br/>nier pour qn.</p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [669.44, 372.13, 1210.8799999999999, 488.07]}, {"polygon": [[221.44, 512.38], [641.28, 512.38], [641.28, 544.17], [221.44, 544.17]], "confidence": 0.9675410220516297, "label": "Text", "raw_label": "Text", "reading_order": 7, "html": "<p>kwákányīrwá~kúákányīrwá (appl.+pass.)</p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, 